@@ -0,0 +1,303 @@
+#
+# Makefile for FreeType2 link library using gcc 4.0.3 from the
+# AmigaOS4 SDK
+#
+
+
+# Copyright 2005-2016 by
+# Werner Lemberg and Detlef W�rkner.
