+  /*************************************************************************
+   *
+   * @func:
+   *   FT_Get_SubGlyph_Info
+   *
+   * @description:
+   *   Retrieve a description of a given subglyph.  Only use it if
+   *   `glyph->format' is @FT_GLYPH_FORMAT_COMPOSITE; an error is
+   *   returned otherwise.
