+   * @output:
+   *   acache ::
+   *     A new cache handle.  NULL in case of error.
+   *
+   * @return:
+   *   FreeType error code.  0~means success.
+   *
+   * @note:
+   *   Like all other caches, this one will be destroyed with the cache
+   *   manager.
