+   *     Unicode version 1.0.
+   *
+   *   TT_APPLE_ID_UNICODE_1_1 ::
+   *     Unicode 1.1; specifies Hangul characters starting at U+34xx.
+   *
+   *   TT_APPLE_ID_ISO_10646 ::
+   *     Deprecated (identical to preceding).
+   *
+   *   TT_APPLE_ID_UNICODE_2_0 ::
